<title>USA: Colonial Commercial Corp Q4 shr $0.04.</title>
<headline>Colonial Commercial Corp Q4 shr $0.04.</headline>
<dateline>LEVITTOWN, N.Y. 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					    1996		    1995(a)</p>
<p> Revenues		     $  25,194,337		13,957,286</p>
<p> Net Income(b)			547,675		   875,259</p>
<p>Net Income per common</p>
<p>   and preferred share		 0.04			0.06</p>
<p>					Three Months Ended December 31,</p>
<p>					    1996			1995</p>
<p> Revenues			   7,437,226		 6,306,258</p>
<p> Net Income(b)			581,290		 1,122,375</p>
<p>Net Income per common</p>
<p>  and preferred share		  0.04			0.07</p>
<p>(a)Includes results from operations of Atlantic Hardware and Supply Corp from May 19, 1995, the date of its acquisition.</p>
<p>(b)  Net income includes gain on sale of land of $258,651 for the three months ended and the year ended December 31, 1996 and $744,936 for the three months ended and the year ended December 31, 1995.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1700</p>
